# NOTE: deployment glue is SOURCE and is tracked under deploy/<target>/.
# The former `scripts/start_hf.sh` and `Dockerfile.hf` entries were excluded
# here, which meant Dockerfile.hf COPYd a file that did not exist in a clean
# clone and could not build (P1-15). Both now live in deploy/huggingface/.
#
# The superseded copies still sit untracked in this working tree. They are
# ignored so nobody mistakes them for the live entrypoint, and left on disk
# because removing a developer's local files is not this repo's call.
/Dockerfile.hf
/scripts/start_hf.sh

README_HF.md

# Generated locally by the graph explorer, not source.
/test_graph.html

# A separate project that happens to be checked out inside this tree. It has its
# own git repository and is not part of this one.
/AD/
